==Battleground==
*7 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*4 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Karin Nekozuka (Enemy)|Karin Nekozuka]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

